The team store dual write is cutover-incomplete for `team_member.legalhold_status`: the LegalHoldStore writes that column directly against Cassandra (`setUserLegalHoldStatus`), outside the TeamStore dual-write interpreter, so the Postgres mirror can go stale. This is deliberate (WPB-22960: keep the Cassandra-only LegalHoldStore boundary until that store migrates); reads remain on Cassandra until cutover, and the gap must be closed before team members cut over to Postgres.
